WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.020
Well, I'm off!

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:07.130
Onee-chan, you're gonna be late for school.

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:10.590
Bluh? My alarm clock hasn't even...

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:14.660
Don't tell me...

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:17.280
Jululu!

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.280
Get it together, Onee-chan!

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:22.750
You have to do a proper job
as Jululu's mother until we find her.

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:24.720
See you later, Jululu!

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:25.750
Bye-bye!

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:26.700
Baa-baa!

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:28.840
Oh, I almost forgot.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:32.500
Today, Triangle's Pinon-sama's concert is going to be on PriPara TV.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.500
Isn't it exciting?

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.490
Well, I'm off!

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.420
I'd better hurry and get changed, too!

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:43.670
Milk?

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:48.080
Done!

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:54.040
Now, let's get ready to...

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.380
Jululu, don't play with your milk; just drink it!

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.520
Jululu, no!

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:08.350
Jululu, put your nappy back on!

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:11.870
Wait up! Hold on a minute!

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:19.770
Come on, I've had enough!

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:24.050
Jululu, get back inside your compact, now!

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:38.420
Thanks for breakfast!

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:39.950
Gonna be late!

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:41.390
I'm off!

00:01:41.390 --> 00:01:42.620
Have a good day!

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:48.820
Always in a hurry, that daughter of mine.

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:49.530
Hm?

00:01:49.530 --> 00:01:51.620
So much left over...

00:01:54.850 --> 00:01:57.070
Wait up, wait up!

00:01:58.030 --> 00:01:59.850
School rule article 115:

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:02.480
Students shall arrive
ten minutes prior to class!

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:04.820
I'm sorry...

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:06.400
Also, Manaka-san.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:09.440
This isn't an infringement, but
there's a clam shell stuck to your chest.

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:10.880
A clam shell?

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.960
Oh no, I got them mixed up!

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:18.170
Capisce!

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:20.370
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:21.920
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:25.170
Collect Divine Coords and become a Divine Idol!

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:28.700
One day, I discovered a mysterious baby in PriPara!

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:31.180
She started calling me "Mama"...

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:32.680
I can't believe this!

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:10.210
Tomato Salad
Spaghetti alle vongole
Pasta With Salad

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:13.550
Okay, class, start on your dishes in your assigned groups.

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:15.550
Okay!

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:18.850
<i>I left Jululu at home all alone.</i>

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:23.550
<i>No, it's Jululu's fault.
She was messing around the whole morning...</i>

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:28.020
<i>And I wound up late in the first place because she broke my alarm clock!</i>

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:34.770
<i>But it </i>is<i> a relief not to have to look after her...</i>

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:37.450
<i>Looking after a baby really wears you out.</i>

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:40.480
<i>I finally have some time to myself.</i>

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:41.720
Yay!

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:43.130
You seem infested with cheer.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:44.640
Geru?

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:46.180
Looks tasty-nanon!

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:46.450
Oi, Mikan, give it back!
Looks tasty-nanon!

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:48.450
Oi, Mikan, give it back!

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:50.300
Oh no, Jululu!

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:51.880
<i>Calm down, Lala!</i>

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.880
<i>Today you brought a clam shell by mistake, remember?</i>

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:56.640
What's "Jululu"? Some kind of spell?

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:06.920
Mama?

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:16.240
<i>I wonder how Jululu's doing right now...</i>

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:23.120
<i>I've never seen her look like that before.</i>

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:29.960
<i>Jululu...</i>

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:34.850
<i>Did I get too mad at her earlier?</i>

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:36.540
<i>Even though I'm her mama...</i>

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:44.850
What was that? Was that from Lala's room?

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:53.070
<i>I should have gone back and picked up Jululu after all...</i>

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:55.320
Lala, you don't seem interested in your food.

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:58.810
Is it because you have Italian all the time at your place?

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:01.550
<i>What if she falls off the dresser?</i>

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:04.020
<i>What if she gets hungry?</i>

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:07.000
Who–Who's there?

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:08.340
Eh?

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:11.580
Ah, the pencil sharpener fell off.

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:17.080
Let's get some air in here.

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:21.770
<i>Okay, let's go home and get Jululu.</i>

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.390
Ugh...

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:24.570
Manaka-san.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:25.370
What are you doing?

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:27.190
Head Disciplinarian!

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:28.860
School rule article 39571!

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:30.540
Is Prohibited!
Leaving The Grounds
School rule article 39571!

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:33.150
Students shall not leave school grounds without permission!

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:42.200
Well, it's just... you see...

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:45.140
Actually, the other day in PriPara...

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:46.510
Onee-chan!

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:47.680
Non!

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:53.520
Check it out! Along with the
Animal Caretaking Committee,

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:55.710
this term I've joined the Broadcasting Committee!

00:06:57.160 --> 00:06:58.910
This lunchtime I'm proud to bring you

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:03.860
the first live concert of the
hottest new idol, Triangle's Pinon-sama!

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.670
It's about to start, everyone!

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:08.950
Ooh.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.210
What is this?

00:07:10.210 --> 00:07:11.780
What's going on?

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:18.060
Well then, let's switch on the VTR.

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:21.230
Hewwo, everyone! We're pleased to bring you the super pop,

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:24.870
happy-happy Pinon's live video today-ucha!

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:29.520
Hi, everyone! Who's the Friendly Princess of Planet Pinon?

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:31.740
It's Pinon-pipi!

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:34.390
Yay! Let's go-pipi!

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:37.710
Pippi pappi puu!

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:51.950
Pipi!

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:55.800
Making Drama, switch on!

00:08:58.170 --> 00:08:59.330
Zoom!

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:06.550
Hm? Ehe! Swoosh!

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:09.020
Let's go! Yeah!

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:11.940
Get together and make a pop sensation!

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.210
Everyone join hands!

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:17.650
Secret wonderful scope!

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:22.270
Cyalume Change!

00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:29.440
Pipi!

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:56.520
What a cute, poppy concert!

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:59.120
Her show was like a fresh breeze...

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:00.740
A formidable foe.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:02.000
Isn't she the best?

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:05.630
I joined Triangle's fan club right away.

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:09.260
You still love each new idol
more than the last, I see.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:29.030
School's finally over!

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:32.240
Hold on, Jululu. Mama's
coming back right now.

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:34.420
Hm?

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:35.720
Eh?

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:40.530
J–Jululu!?

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:53.200
Jululu!

00:10:57.810 --> 00:11:01.240
Wait up! Why is this happening?

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:10.900
Wah! What is this stuff?

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:12.880
Ugh...

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:16.380
Kitty!

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:23.770
Where'd you go, Jululu?

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:26.920
Hey, Lala! What are you doing?

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:30.350
I know – are you playing ninja?

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:32.860
No, I'm not! The baby's in real trouble!

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:34.510
A baby again?

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:37.530
Um, so there's a baby around here riding a cat...

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:37.930
Heh.

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:39.680
It's true!

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:40.810
Say, Lala.

00:11:40.810 --> 00:11:43.680
Is that maybe the cat you're looking for?

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:48.880
Hey, that's the cat! But where's Jululu?

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:52.670
Ah!

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:01.180
S–See you later!

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:03.740
A thunderclap hurricane.

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:10.620
She's not in here!
Is she in the supermarket?

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:18.740
Attention, everyone, the limited-time sale's starting!

00:12:18.740 --> 00:12:21.040
One head of cabbage for only 50 yen!

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:22.510
Jululu!

00:12:23.770 --> 00:12:25.260
Oof...

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.090
Julu...lu!

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:32.260
It's a cabbage...

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:34.760
Hm? How strange...

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:37.250
This cabbage doesn't have a barcode.

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:38.990
Jululu!

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:40.390
Excuse me, young lady.

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:42.080
You can't cut in line.

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:43.600
Come on.

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:45.140
But... Ah!

00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:03.060
Ah... I lost track of her...

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:05.050
Where'd Jululu go?

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:07.770
Ah!

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:14.510
Hey! Jululu!

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:19.640
<i>If she fell from that high up...</i>

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:24.960
Jululu!

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:34.120
Hello.

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:36.190
Hey, Sophie, have you seen a baby around?

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:37.860
A baby?

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:41.100
If you see a baby up in the sky at all, tell me right away!

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:43.840
A baby in the sky?

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:46.200
I want to fly together.

00:13:48.730 --> 00:13:49.550
Pushu...

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:53.040
Jululu! Jululu!

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:58.020
Manaka-san? You look distressed; what's going on?

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:01.730
Did a baby fall from the sky around here, from way high up?

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.610
A baby from the sky?

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:06.770
Manaka-san, just what's going on?
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:11.160
I'll tell you about it later! If you see the baby, please let me know!

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:12.480
If you say so...

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:13.400
Thanks!

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:28.110
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:33.280
Jululu! Jululu!

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:35.850
Where did she go...

00:14:36.070 --> 00:14:37.040
Don't tell me...

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:42.590
No, it's fine. It's fine. She's just hiding somewhere; I know it.

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:48.970
There she is!

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:51.070
Jululu!

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:55.060
Why does she have to be with the principal?

00:14:55.280 --> 00:14:56.510
What do I do...

00:14:57.190 --> 00:14:58.450
Mama!

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:00.650
Young Manaka's a <i>mama</i>?!

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:02.880
What exactly is going on here?

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:06.350
I look forward to a full and thorough explanation in my office!

00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:10.540
That'd turn into a nightmare!

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:17.380
Jululu... Jululu...

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:24.070
I must be imagining things.

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:25.820
Well, then.

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:33.900
Wait up!

00:15:50.280 --> 00:15:51.900
I'm coming to get you!

00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:02.580
Hold on, Jululu – I'm coming!

00:16:09.890 --> 00:16:11.750
Hold on, Jululu!

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:13.690
Mama!

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:15.200
Jululu.

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:21.560
Wah! Mama...

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:25.200
Mama... Mama!

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:26.240
Jululu.

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:27.440
Mama!

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:36.440
Jululu.

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:37.610
Mama!

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:39.890
Jululu!

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:41.570
Mama!

00:16:41.570 --> 00:16:45.370
I'm so sorry, Jululu. I'm sorry I left you all alone.

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:46.510
Mama!

00:16:46.510 --> 00:16:48.480
I'm so glad you're okay.

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:54.750
Mama, Mama.

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:56.080
What is it?

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:02.370
What's that? You want to see Mama perform?

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:05.740
Of course – you love concerts, don't you?

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:08.190
All right – capisce!

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:24.260
Scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:27.520
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:29.700
Starting the Coord Change.

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:37.350
PriPara's latest coord, with a cool and cute short jacket style.

00:17:37.350 --> 00:17:39.510
Diamond Check Sweet Coord!

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:47.980
The colourful diamond pattern shows off each member's individuality.

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:50.550
Diamond Check Vivid Coord!

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:51.600
Pri!

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:57.140
The three members' mismatched socks draw the eye too!

00:17:57.140 --> 00:17:59.060
Which is your favourite type?

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:01.530
Diamond Check Rose Coord!

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:38.360
Mama! Mama!

00:18:42.440 --> 00:18:45.820
Making Drama, switch on!

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:51.060
Amazing

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:53.030
surprise!

00:18:57.050 --> 00:18:58.120
Carry it

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:58.960
to everyone!

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:00.430
Have some pizza, too!

00:19:01.690 --> 00:19:05.300
Present for you!

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:10.040
Cyalume Change!

00:19:37.060 --> 00:19:37.790
Kirarin!

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:41.980
Mama!

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:43.960
Pri!

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:51.220
Is – is this...

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:58.680
I am Jewlie.

00:19:58.680 --> 00:20:01.340
I show the path to becoming a Divine Idol.

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:04.270
Jewlie... the goddess appears!

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:13.980
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:19.120
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:31.320
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:36.870
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:20:59.390 --> 00:21:02.880
The closet's doors open for you...

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:05.260
Within is a coord fit for a Divine Idol!

00:21:22.430 --> 00:21:23.810
D–Did you see that?

00:21:23.810 --> 00:21:25.070
I did! I did!

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:25.770
W–What was that?

00:21:25.770 --> 00:21:27.020
What just happened?

00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:28.940
Who was that goddess-looking person?

00:21:28.940 --> 00:21:30.800
It was amazing...

00:21:30.940 --> 00:21:33.070
Has the caldron of Hell been opened?

00:21:33.070 --> 00:21:35.660
I have no idea what just happened-kuma.

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:41.550
Lala, what happened just now-pri?

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:45.190
I... Where did you two go just now?

00:21:45.190 --> 00:21:50.020
We were in the stands at a stage we'd never seen, and watched you perform.

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:52.810
What's this?

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:56.600
Everybody!

00:21:57.260 --> 00:22:01.250
What Lala holds right now is a Super Cyalume Coord!

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:02.850
Super Cyalume?

00:22:02.850 --> 00:22:03.890
What is that?

00:22:03.890 --> 00:22:05.720
It sounds amazing!

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:11.720
Which is to say... the long-awaited
Divine Idol Grand Prix has now begun!

00:22:21.200 --> 00:22:24.470
Now, grab your jewel mic

00:22:24.910 --> 00:22:27.750
It's time to be an idol!

00:22:27.750 --> 00:22:32.200
Making Drama, switch on!

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:33.560
Let's go!

00:22:33.560 --> 00:22:36.420
Pu-ri-pa-ra, pu-ri-pu-ri dancing!

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:39.470
Say it cutely: Capisce!

00:22:39.470 --> 00:22:45.360
With your fancy coord and cute jewels,

00:22:45.360 --> 00:22:51.040
Sing your lovely song
(Yay, yay, woo!)

00:22:51.070 --> 00:23:00.910
Isn't it exciting?
Hold on to all you have – it's a precious treasure

00:23:00.910 --> 00:23:02.540
Yay! Yay! Wooo!

00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:05.310
Mi mi mi so la! (Mi mi mi so la!)

00:23:05.340 --> 00:23:07.880
Re re re mi so! (Re re re mi so!)

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:13.540
So! La! Ti! Do! Sing it and get ready for

00:23:13.540 --> 00:23:16.380
Pu-ri-pa-ra, pu-ri-pu-ri dancing!

00:23:16.380 --> 00:23:18.420
Say it cutely, yay!

00:23:18.420 --> 00:23:22.130
Special, happy, happy, reach for it!
(Yay!)

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:24.990
Lucky, lucky, go and play your song
(Yay! Yay!)

00:23:25.020 --> 00:23:29.930
Tell it with a do-re-mi-fa-so-la-ti-do!
(Wooooooo!)

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:33.520
I've got my jewel mic
(Woo!)

00:23:33.520 --> 00:23:36.400
On that heart-pounding stage
(Woo! Woo!)

00:23:36.400 --> 00:23:42.640
Sing it with a do-re-mi-fa-so-la-ti-do!

00:23:42.670 --> 00:23:46.340
Let's go!
Pu-ri-pa-ra, pu-ri-pu-ri dancing!

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:49.980
Say it cutely: Capisce!

00:23:52.120 --> 00:23:53.690
Way to go, Lala-kuma!

